    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "The volume of water $V$ in litres flowing through a pipe after $t$ seconds is given by $V=t^2+3t$. Find the rate at which the water is flowing when $t=5$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$13\\text{ L/s}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dV}{dt}&=2t+3\\\\\\left.\\frac{dV}{dt}\\right|_{t=5}&=2(5)+3\\\\&=13\\text{ L/s}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
